WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
They also sell pork, right?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,880
So I won’t show it to you.

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,680
To save you from looking at Zen Nao Xin

4
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:14,830
Where can I eat it now?

5
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,120
You don’t have to go out of your way to entertain me

6
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,320
You can eat whatever you usually eat, big brother

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:21,160
This is how we usually eat

8
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:25,710
Keep a low profile

9
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:27,270
So as not to be helpful and thorough

10
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,160
Don't be discouraged

11
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,760
Although much worse than me

12
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,520
But you are better than other bases

13
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,040
As long as you don't compare with me

14
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,200
You are still a pretty powerful base in the eyes of others.
